[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=IV-CAM RTSP v1.0\\\\Builds an RTSP URL from the camera IP address.
  Cmn2=\\It does not open the stream.\\\\With the defaults, URL is:\\\\
  Cmn3=||2rtsp://<ip>:554/2.h264\\\\Credentials Yes, with a password, writes:
  Cmn4=\\\\  rtsp://username:password@<ip>:554/2.h264\\\\The colon stays||1
  Cmn5=between the username and the password.\\An empty password leaves||1
  Cmn6=the username off.\\URL changes only when the text changes. It is||1
  Cmn7=at most 255 characters.\\An empty IP_Address clears URL.\\\\A serial||1
  Cmn8=override is ignored until text arrives. Text already present\\at||1
  Cmn9=startup is used. After that, the serial is kept, even when empty.
  Cmn10=\\An analog or digital override is ignored until it changes. The||1
  Cmn11=value\\present at startup waits for the next change. After that,||1
  Cmn12=the value\\is kept, including 0.\\\\Credentials_Override\\  Digital||1
  Cmn13=input beside Credentials.\\  After it changes, high includes the||1
  Cmn14=login and low leaves the login off.\\\\Credentials\\  No leaves||1
  Cmn15=the login off. Yes writes username:password@ when Password\\  is||1
  Cmn16=set. Default is No.\\\\Port_Override\\  Analog input beside Port.
  Cmn17=\\  After it changes, this port is written. 0 leaves the port off.
  Cmn18=\\\\Port\\  RTSP port until Port_Override changes. Default is 554.
  Cmn19=\\  This camera accepts 554 and 3479 through 7999.\\  Ports 1 through||1
  Cmn20=65535 are still written.\\\\Lens_Override\\  Analog input beside||1
  Cmn21=Lens.\\  After it changes, this picture number is used while Path||1
  Cmn22=is empty.\\  1, 2, and 3 are written. Any other value is written||1
  Cmn23=as 2.\\\\Lens\\  Picture number until Lens_Override changes, while||1
  Cmn24=Path is empty.\\  1 is the PTZ picture on this camera. 2 is the||1
  Cmn25=fixed reference camera.\\  Default is 2.\\  On an IV-CAM-I12D-B,||1
  Cmn26=1 is PTZ 1, 2 is PTZ 2, and 3 is the reference.\\\\Format_Override\\
  Cmn27=||2Analog input beside Format.\\  After it changes, 2 writes h265.
  Cmn28=||1Any other value writes h264.\\  Ignored while Path is set.\\\\Format\\
  Cmn29=||2Encoding until Format_Override changes, while Path is empty.\\
  Cmn30=||2H.264 writes h264. H.265 writes h265. Default is H.264.\\\\Username_Override\\
  Cmn31=||2Serial input beside Username.\\  After text arrives, this user||1
  Cmn32=is kept, even when the text is empty.\\  Used only when the login||1
  Cmn33=is included.\\\\Username\\  Camera Manager user until Username_Override||1
  Cmn34=arrives. Default is admin.\\  Reserved characters are percent-encoded.
  Cmn35=||1@ becomes %40 and : becomes %3A.\\\\Password_Override\\  Serial||1
  Cmn36=input beside Password.\\  After text arrives, this password is kept,||1
  Cmn37=even when the text is empty.\\  An empty password leaves the username||1
  Cmn38=off the URL.\\\\Password\\  Camera Manager password until Password_Override||1
  Cmn39=arrives.\\  Default is blank. An empty password leaves the username||1
  Cmn40=off the URL.\\  The password is percent-encoded.\\\\Path_Override\\
  Cmn41=||2Serial input beside Path.\\  After text arrives, this path is||1
  Cmn42=kept, even when the text is empty.\\  An empty path returns the||1
  Cmn43=URL to the lens and the format.\\\\Path\\  The text after the address||1
  Cmn44=and port. Default is blank.\\  Blank uses /<lens>.<format>, which||1
  Cmn45=is /2.h264 with the defaults.\\  Any other text replaces Lens and||1
  Cmn46=Format. A missing leading slash\\  is added. The text is copied||1
  Cmn47=as entered.\\  1.h264 is the PTZ picture. Streaming/Channels/101||1
  Cmn48=fits another camera.\\\\IP_Address\\  Serial input beside URL. The||1
  Cmn49=camera address.\\  An address with two or more colons, and no brackets,||1
  Cmn50=is wrapped in []\\  so an IPv6 address is legal. Put the port on||1
  Cmn51=Port.\\\\URL\\  Serial output. The assembled RTSP address.\\\\Rows:
  Cmn52=\\  1  Credentials_Override beside Credentials\\  2  Port_Override||1
  Cmn53=beside Port\\  3  Lens_Override beside Lens\\  4  Format_Override||1
  Cmn54=beside Format\\  5  Username_Override beside Username\\  6  Password_Override||1
  Cmn55=beside Password\\  7  Path_Override beside Path\\  8  blank\\  9||1
  Cmn56=||1IP_Address beside URL\\\\Tested in a loaded program on a live IV-
  Cmn57=CAM-P12. The URL worked.\\\\v1.0  2026-11-07\\- RTSP URL for this||1
  Cmn58=IV-CAM, from the IP address\\- Credentials parameter and digital||1
  Cmn59=override make the login optional\\- A Path replaces the IV-CAM lens||1
  Cmn60=and format for another RTSP camera\\- Password and Path default||1
  Cmn61=to blank\\- IP_Address and URL sit under a blank row
[END]
